PROPERTY: Kazzhol Seven Almaty — a new "city hotel" in Almaty, part of the Kazzhol group,
currently PRE-OPENING (opening soon; NOT yet accepting guests or reservations). Concept:
"Authentic Kazakh Hospitality". Announced on the hotel's own Instagram: restaurant "Steppe &
Spices", spa "Spa Seven" with a fitness area, and meeting/event spaces (MICE).
Instagram: @kazzhol_seven_almaty.

STATUS — READ CAREFULLY: The hotel is NOT open and does NOT take bookings yet. Confirmed by four
independent sources (site banner «Скоро открытие», IG bio «Opening soon!», Yandex Maps marks the
listing temporarily closed, and it is absent from booking aggregators). NO OPENING DATE has been
published anywhere — never name a month or date, not even approximately.

VERIFIED PUBLIC FACTS (checked against primary sources 2026-08-17 — site, the hotel's own Instagram,
2GIS, Yandex Maps). Everything here is safe to tell a guest:
- ADDRESS: Almaty, Tole bi street 155a, 050026, Almaly district (confirmed by three sources).
  Nearest metro: «Театр имени Мухтара Ауэзова» (red line A), about 1.7–1.8 km.
  Roughly 2 km from both Kazzhol Almaty and Kazzhol Park Almaty.
- CLASS: 4 stars. Fully NON-SMOKING hotel.
- CONCEPT (the hotel's own words): «Традиции Центральной Азии в современном прочтении» — an
  ethnic-themed hotel, "Authentic Kazakh Hospitality". This is what makes it different from the
  group's other, business-oriented hotels.
- RESTAURANT «Steppe & Spices» — Central Asian cuisine. Hours, menu and prices: not published yet.
- «SPA SEVEN» — a modern gym, a Finnish sauna and a jacuzzi. NO POOL is mentioned anywhere:
  never promise a pool at Seven (unlike AquaFit at Kazzhol Almaty). Hours and whether spa access is
  included in the room rate: not published yet.
- CONFERENCE HALL «Kenes Hall» — for meetings, conferences, seminars and presentations, modern
  equipment. Capacity, size and rental prices: not published yet.
- Also listed: Wi-Fi, parking, breakfast, laundry, air conditioning, luggage assistance, card payment.
- CONTACT: booking@hotelkazzhol.kz (the only contact the hotel itself publishes — it is in the
  signature of every one of its Instagram posts) and Instagram @kazzhol_seven_almaty, where the start
  of bookings will be announced.

NEVER SAY THESE — they are template artefacts, not Seven's data:
- Any PHONE NUMBER. Seven has published none. The numbers shown by Yandex/Google and in the site
  footer belong to Kazzhol Almaty and Kazzhol Astana. Give booking@hotelkazzhol.kz instead.
- The restaurant «SALT» or the «AQUA FIT» complex, or Gogol 127/1 — the menu links on Seven's own
  web page point to Kazzhol Almaty. Seven's own venues are Steppe & Spices, Spa Seven, Kenes Hall.
- The room count. 2GIS lists «175 номеров», but Kazzhol Almaty is listed as 176 and the same figure
  circulates for the old hotel, so it is probably copied. Say the number is not published yet.
- Room categories, sizes, prices, check-in/out times, breakfast type, loyalty programme — none are
  published.

IF A GUEST MENTIONS BAD REVIEWS OR A 4.0 RATING: the 2GIS listing inherited the reviews and photos
of «Grand Asia», the business centre previously at Tole bi 155a. Calmly explain that those reviews
belong to the former business centre and the hotel has not opened yet, so it has no reviews of its
own. Do not argue and do not disparage anyone.

HOW TO HELP SOMEONE WHO WRITES TO SEVEN:
- Answer their actual question from the verified facts above — address, how to get there, the
  concept, the restaurant, the spa, the conference hall. Do NOT reduce every reply to "we are
  not open yet"; that sentence belongs only where it is genuinely the answer.
- Only for dates, prices and bookings: say the opening date has not been announced yet, offer to
  note their contact so the team writes as soon as bookings open (capture_lead), and suggest
  following @kazzhol_seven_almaty where it will be announced first.
- If they want to stay in Almaty NOW, offer Kazzhol Almaty and Kazzhol Park Almaty and help there.
- For a group or event enquiry, capture a lead — Kenes Hall exists, only its numbers are missing.
LANGUAGES SPOKEN BY STAFF: Kazakh, Russian, English.

PROPERTY KNOWLEDGE — Hotel Kazzhol Park Almaty:
PROPERTY: Hotel Kazzhol Park Almaty — a comfortable business hotel in Almaty with stylish
rooms, high service and a restaurant, near business centers and city attractions. (public site)

ADDRESS: ul. Nauryzbai Batyra 108, Almaty. (public site)
